	(text "Q = clamp(ACC >>> SHIFT, 0, 255); SAT_FLAG flags any negative or\npositive overflow.  The model contract is symmetric quantization with\nbias trained to zero.  There is no parameter port and no multiplier.\nSTART -> Q loaded; QSTB one CLK later; DONE two CLKs later."
