	(text "Implementation notes:\n- QRAW[i] = ACC[9 + i] if < 32 else ACC[31].\n- HIGH = OR(ACC[17..31]); SAT_POS = HIGH & ~ACC[31].\n- First 74HC157 stage selects 0xFF on SAT_POS; second selects 0x00\n  when ACC[31]=1, so negative results clamp to 0 and set SAT_FLAG.\n- Q is a 74HCT574 clocked by START (a one-CLK supervisor pulse).\n- QSTB/DONE are the two 74HC74 stages; BUSY is their OR with START.\n- No bias adder: retrain/export with zero bias, or fold bias into an\n  extra constant input before quantization (documented model contract)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18 70 0)
		(effects
